OL,4,BFrank happy to be 'back in the circus' 
OL,5,Bat Palace                              
OL,6,GThomas Frank is happy to be "back in   
OL,7,Gthe circus" after speaking at his      
OL,8,Gfirst news conference as Crystal       
OL,9,GPalace manager.                        
OL,11,FThe 53-year-old, who was appointed on  
OL,12,Fa two-and-a-half-year deal on Monday,  
OL,13,Fhas been out of work since he was      
OL,14,Fsacked by Tottenham in February, less  
OL,15,Fthan eight months after taking the job.
